  "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</span><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhjiYJPAm84oR3355jnNlHmNwiPqVmvALUOfbGD4zU52Ki1L4KhkX-u7PehC4FMyNeLEWRp7902hChkHdOJkXbvYISL4fC3sW1R-KGIJ0pmghlHxc-GjbvJnWnrLtbgtAorCJfU9-uyj4NXxingMIUxQOuOLMcckSrr5WGrDqnQRyK-xKVDlJtvJuN8_pQ/w200-h183/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" style=\"text-align: center;\" /></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><h2><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\">🕯️ מעט מן האור</span></h2><p data-end=\"789\" data-start=\"705\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לְזָרָא הָיְתָה<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הָאֵשׁ הַזָּרָה.</span></p><p data-end=\"789\" data-start=\"705\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וּמָזוֹר לֹא גָּהָה<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בַּלֶּהָבָה הַמּוּזָרָה.</span></p><p data-end=\"789\" data-start=\"705\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְלַהַט תּוֹצָאוֹת מַזָּרוֹת<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לֹא עָשָׂה נְפָשׁוֹת.</span></p><p data-end=\"789\" data-start=\"705\"><i><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;\"</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">תּוֹצָאוֹת מַזָּרוֹת\" - כינוי לכוכבים ומזלות (איוב ל\"ח ל\"ב)</span></span></i></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">📘 עצה שבועית</span></h2><p></p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><p style=\"clear: both; text-align: right;\">בְּדֹק מֵאֵיזוֹ אֵשׁ אַתָּה פּוֹעֵל.</p><p style=\"clear: both; text-align: right;\">אִם הַדַּחַף שֶׁלְּךָ בָּא מִבֶּהָלָה, מֵהַשְׁוָאָה לַאֲחֵרִים, מִלַּחַץ “לְהוֹכִיחַ” אוֹ מִכּוֹחַ חִיצוֹנִי - זוֹ אֵשׁ זָרָה.</p><p style=\"clear: both; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הִיא יְכוֹלָה לִבְעֹר חָזָק, אֲבָל הִיא לֹא מְרַפְּאָה וְלֹא בּוֹנָה נֶפֶשׁ.</span></p></span><p></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">🌀 הצד השני של המטבע</span></h2><p><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֵשׁ זָרָה בּוֹעֶרֶת מַהֵר,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֵשׁ אֱמֶת בּוֹנָה לְאַט.</span></p><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">💎 פנינה</span></h2></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><p>הספר הקודם - ויקרא, מסתיים במילים \"<span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; text-align: -webkit-center;\">אֵלֶּה הַמִּצְוֺת...\"<br /></span>ספר במדבר - פותח במילים \"בְּמִדְבַּר סִינַי\"</p><p>לומר לך, כי רק מי ששם עצמו כמו \"מִדְבַּר\" (ולא צובר רכוש) - יכול לדעת תורה ומצוות (בעל הטורים).</p><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 242, 204); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">📘 מילון ארמי־עברי</span></h2><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">חמש מילים מארמית שבתורה - עם פענוח והארה לשונית.</i></span><i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"color: #222222; font-style: normal;\">&nbsp;</span></b></i></p><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></p><p><b><span face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"></span></b></p><ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; counter-reset: templateify 0; margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px 20px 0px 0px;\"><li><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span><span>'</span><span><i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"color: #222222; font-style: normal;\">בֶּן</span></b></i>' / '</span><span><i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"color: #222222; font-style: normal;\">בַּר</span></b></i>'</span></span><br /></span></span><span>❖ בן גיל מצוות - בר מצווה</span></span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span>'<i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"color: #222222; font-style: normal;\">נִקְּבוּ</span></b></i>' / '<i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"color: #222222; font-style: normal;\">דְּאִתְפָּרַשׁוּ</span></b></i>'</span><br /></span></span><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖</span><span>&nbsp;ערך נקוב - מוגדר במפורש</span></span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span>'</span><span><i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"color: #222222; font-style: normal;\">צָבָא</span></b></i>' / '<i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"color: #222222; font-style: normal;\">חֵילָא</span></b></i>'</span><br /></span><span>❖ צבא - חיל</span></span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span><span>'<i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"color: #222222; font-style: normal;\">אַךְ</span></b></i>' / '<i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"color: #222222; font-style: normal;\">בְּרַם</span></b></i>'</span></span><br /></span></span><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖</span><span>&nbsp;אלא, אבל - ברם</span></span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span>'<i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"color: #222222; font-style: normal;\">תַּחַת</span></b></i>' / '<i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"color: #222222; font-style: normal;\">חֲלָף</span></b></i>'</span><br /></span><span>❖ במקום - תחליף</span></span></li></ol><div><br /></div><h2 style=\"display: inline; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"></span></div>👁️ מבט חד</span><br /></h2><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><br /></div></span></div></div><br /><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"float: right;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiKgQEeBAc6ElmqyV3tHlgJP6juzU7-R55Ha_aRrqkNFiKDlj3Cb4PJDf8KvsIXvXsmMXRBs161lMqY442ZUXxY6jRb-HTdb8-P-hmCH2_8Cje6LbtfTh-dNfIqBjOI8YHRZ_0_UAwi8KKe0bfgeZqphsrfsTdfT0OQ7LRy_P6puSY4TIj3PzN17pS5YsA/s1536/ChatGPT%20Image%20Jan%2013,%202026,%2004_56_23%20PM.png\" style=\"clear: right; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img alt=\"איור של מדחום אדום שמטפס לאזור רותח ומעלה להבות, כסמל להתלהבות קיצונית ומסוכנת\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1536\" data-original-width=\"1024\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiKgQEeBAc6ElmqyV3tHlgJP6juzU7-R55Ha_aRrqkNFiKDlj3Cb4PJDf8KvsIXvXsmMXRBs161lMqY442ZUXxY6jRb-HTdb8-P-hmCH2_8Cje6LbtfTh-dNfIqBjOI8YHRZ_0_UAwi8KKe0bfgeZqphsrfsTdfT0OQ7LRy_P6puSY4TIj3PzN17pS5YsA/w133-h200/ChatGPT%20Image%20Jan%2013,%202026,%2004_56_23%20PM.png\" width=\"133\" /></a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כשהאש זרה</span></td></tr></tbody></table><br />"
